    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want you to play this typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just type the keys as instructed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need to think at all.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror typing game &quot;Dyping&quot;, played over 250,000 times, has received a massive upgrade and is now officially released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now back with infinitely more despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dying-Typing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ominous &quot;Eyes&quot; present you with disturbing typing prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The words you type become reality and come back to haunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please kill me.&quot; If you type this sentence, you die. Game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/246cffe5979413d1ac11c0dfa7044e6d.poster.avif?t=1743606240\" width=606 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/246cffe5979413d1ac11c0dfa7044e6d.webm?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/246cffe5979413d1ac11c0dfa7044e6d.mp4?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Game From the Outside</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with unavoidable, unfair deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the sinister text appears, it seems like your only choice is to type it and march toward your demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...But perhaps, you can still open the &quot;Settings Screen.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/95aa57d6ae2a28644e037840e17e4411.poster.avif?t=1743606240\" width=606 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/95aa57d6ae2a28644e037840e17e4411.webm?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/95aa57d6ae2a28644e037840e17e4411.mp4?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Typing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the deaths imposed by the Eyes grow increasingly unreasonable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you obtain &quot;fragments&quot;\u2014cards that allow you to alter words and letters\u2014you can fight back against its malice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ever-changing fragments in each playthrough to defeat the Eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/15f2878291a602903a58e8595f05a430.poster.avif?t=1743606240\" width=606 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/15f2878291a602903a58e8595f05a430.webm?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/15f2878291a602903a58e8595f05a430.mp4?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;I want you to play this typing game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just type the keys as instructed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's no need to think at all.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horror typing game &quot;Dyping&quot;, played over 250,000 times, has received a massive upgrade and is now officially released.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now back with infinitely more despair.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Dying-Typing Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The ominous &quot;Eyes&quot; present you with disturbing typing prompts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The words you type become reality and come back to haunt you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Please kill me.&quot; If you type this sentence, you die. Game over.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/246cffe5979413d1ac11c0dfa7044e6d.poster.avif?t=1743606240\" width=606 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/246cffe5979413d1ac11c0dfa7044e6d.webm?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/246cffe5979413d1ac11c0dfa7044e6d.mp4?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Break the Game From the Outside</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is filled with unavoidable, unfair deaths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the sinister text appears, it seems like your only choice is to type it and march toward your demise.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...But perhaps, you can still open the &quot;Settings Screen.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/95aa57d6ae2a28644e037840e17e4411.poster.avif?t=1743606240\" width=606 height=76 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/95aa57d6ae2a28644e037840e17e4411.webm?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/95aa57d6ae2a28644e037840e17e4411.mp4?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Roguelike Typing</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, the deaths imposed by the Eyes grow increasingly unreasonable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, if you obtain &quot;fragments&quot;\u2014cards that allow you to alter words and letters\u2014you can fight back against its malice.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the ever-changing fragments in each playthrough to defeat the Eyes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/15f2878291a602903a58e8595f05a430.poster.avif?t=1743606240\" width=606 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/15f2878291a602903a58e8595f05a430.webm?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3406810/extras/15f2878291a602903a58e8595f05a430.mp4?t=1743606240\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
